  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate and Optimize Media Processing with AWS Elemental MediaConvert",
    "splashDescription": "AWS Elemental is a cloud services that helps you create, transform, and deliver digital content. This blueprint integrates the capabilities of AWS Elemental with Camunda to streamline video transcoding operations. It supports a variety of media tasks, including adjusting frame rates and resolution, adding caption and audio tracks, merging multiple videos, overlaying images onto videos, and more. Additionally, it provides essential functionalities such as file uploads and downloads from Amazon S3, content moderation detection, and generating presigned URLs for secure delivery.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/450957/overview/img8606995252017739326.png?c9a72c564835d317a211373244a71c24",
